## Purpose
Replace outdated README product GIFs with current native UI walkthroughs,
including the new learning/practice features and understandable visible clicks.
Keep decorative branding/meme animations and immutable release assets unchanged.

## Tasks
- [x] Inspect old captures and current native controls.
