## Acceptance criteria
- Product GIFs show current application controls, not stale prototype views.
- A visible pointer and click effects make the demonstrated actions understandable.
- Captured clicks/keys/drags actually operate the native widgets; overlays are labelled.
- Market charts use actual completed provider history, not fabricated examples.
- Manual scenario inputs remain unmistakably hypothetical.
- Capture runs own offscreen windows/cache, never the user's OS mouse or open app.
- Captions, sources, hashes, dates and limitations agree with the captured actions.
- Logo/meme artwork and the frozen v1.0.0 release remain unchanged.

